{"displayStem":"급성 호흡곤란으로 온 환자에게 같은 유량의 산소를 유지하면서 관찰하였다. 그림은 시간에 따른 산소포화도와 동맥 CO₂의 모의 추세이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><div class=\"C04-dual\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 390\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 21a의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"390\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"65\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">산소포화도 (%)</text><path d=\"M75 65L75 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M75 290L580 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"325.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><text x=\"575.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><polyline points=\"75.0,88.4 325.0,88.4 575.0,88.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75.0\" cy=\"88.4\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"325.0\" cy=\"88.4\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></c